  "b6168479-406c-4e82-b807-50ae6886bee6": "Specifies key elements as defined in the original transaction.",
  "bf413c78-37ae-4bd7-bfe4-b88659e3626d": "Scope|The CustomerPaymentReversal message is sent by the initiating party to the next party in the payment chain. It is used to reverse a payment previously executed.|Usage|The CustomerPaymentReversal message is exchanged between a non-financial institution customer and an agent to reverse a CustomerDirectDebitInitiation message that has been settled. The result will be a credit on the debtor account.|The CustomerPaymentReversal message refers to the original CustomerDirectDebitInitiation message by means of references only or by means of references and a set of elements from the original instruction.|The CustomerPaymentReversal message can be used in domestic and cross-border scenarios.",
